Package: Rwapor
Title: Download WaPOR and AgERA5 Data
Version: 0.9.8
Authors@R: c(
    person("Almutaz", "Mohammed", email = "almutaz.mohammed@fao.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("WaPOR-DL", "Contributors", email = "wapor@fao.org", role = "aut"),
    person("FAO", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Downloads and processes WaPOR (Water Productivity Open-access portal)
    and AgERA5 raster data from the FAO GIS Manager API. Provides functions for
    extracting time series, calculating zonal statistics for regions and polygons,
    downloading raster maps, unit conversion, and seasonal crop water productivity
    analysis. Supports WaPOR Level 1, Level 2, Level 3 data products and AgERA5
    climate variables. Includes an interactive Shiny dashboard for data exploration
    and analysis with crop mask integration and seasonal indicator computation.
